(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF FINANCE) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PRADHAN MANTRI MUDRA YOJANA \(PMMY\) \(PMMY\) / MUDRA / COMMERCIAL BANKS / RRBS / SMALL FINANCE BANKS / MFIS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Refinance agency scheme funding non-corporate, non-farm small/micro) Tj
T*
(enterprises with collateral-free loans across Shishu, Kishore, and Tarun) Tj
T*
(categories.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Any Indian citizen with a viable business plan for income-generating) Tj
T*
(   non-farm activities.) Tj
T*
(2. Sectors include manufacturing, processing, trading, retail, services,) Tj
T*
(   and allied agricultural activities.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Loans in four tiers: Shishu \(up to Rs. 50,000\), Kishore \(Rs. 50,000 to Rs. 5) Tj
T*
(   Lakh\), Tarun \(Rs. 5 Lakh to Rs. 10 Lakh\), and Tarun Plus \(up to Rs. 20 Lakh\).) Tj
T*
(   Zero collateral requirement.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 20.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Aadhaar and PAN Card) Tj
T*
(2. Business Address Proof / Shop Establishment License) Tj
T*
(3. Last 6 months Bank Statement) Tj
T*
(4. Quotation of machinery / raw materials to be purchased) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via Jan Samarth / Udyamimitra or branch visit) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.jansamarth.in/mudra-loan-scheme) Tj
T*
